<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND V PAKISTAN FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND V PAKISTAN FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>LAHORE, Pakistan 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the fourth</p>
<p>day of the first cricket test between Pakistan and New Zealand</p>
<p>on Sunday:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 155 (Waqar Younis 4-48, Mushtaq</p>
<p>Ahmad 4-59)</p>
<p>Pakistan first innings 191 (Moin Khan 59, S.Doull 5-46,</p>
<p>J.Vaughan 4-27)</p>
<p>New Zealnad second innings 311 (S.Fleming 92 not out,</p>
<p>C.Cairns 93; Mushtaq Ahmad 6-84)</p>
<p>Pakistan second innings (overnight 46-5)</p>
<p> Saeed Anwar lbw b Doull			    0</p>
<p> Zahoor Elahi c Young b Patel		     6</p>
<p> Ijaz Ahmad b Doull				   8</p>
<p> Inzamamul Haq c Young b Cairns		  14</p>
<p> Saqlain Mushtaq c Fleming b Vaughan	    0</p>
<p> Salim Malik c Germon b Doull		    21</p>
<p> Mohammad Wasim not out			   109</p>
<p> Moin Khan c Germon b Astle			38</p>
<p> Mushtaq Ahmad c Fleming b Patel		 15</p>
<p> Waqar Younis b Patel				 1</p>
<p> Shahid Nazir c Harris b Patel		    1</p>
<p> Extra (b-8 lb-8 nb-2)			     18</p>
<p> Total (all out)				    231</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-0 2-8 3-25 4-26 5-42 6-60 7-135 8-211</p>
<p>9-219</p>
<p>Bowling: Doull 16-4-39-3, Cairns 16-5-62-1 (2nb), Vaughan</p>
<p>14-5-48-1, Patel 15.1-6-36-4, Harris 6-2-20-0, Astle 4-1-10-1.</p>
<p>Result: New Zealanad won by 44 runs.</p>
<p>Second test: November 28-Dec 2, at Rawalpindi.</p>
